   "subject": "Where can I get the ggplot2 package(ver 1.0.0)?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I leraned ggplot2 for scatter plots from &quot;ggplot2: The Elements for Elegant Data Visualization in R&quot;. It is unable to draw a \r\n<span style=\"font-family:LMRoman12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">regression line with the qplot() function in the recent version of ggplot2. I used the following code to draw a </span>scatter plot.<span style=\"font-family:LMRoman12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br style=\"text-align:-webkit-auto\"></span><div><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">p &lt;- <span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>ggplot</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(mtcars, <span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>aes</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">x=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">wt, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">y=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpg, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">color=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">cyl, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">shape=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">cyl)) +<br><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>geom_point</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">() +<br><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>geom_smooth</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">method=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lm, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">se=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\">FALSE<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">fullrange=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\">TRUE<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)+<br><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>theme_classic</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()<br><span style=\"font-family:LMMono10-Italic;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\"><i># Use brewer color palettes</i><br><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">p+<span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><b>scale_color_brewer</b><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\">palette=<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(79,153,5)\">&quot;Dark2&quot;<span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"text-align:-webkit-auto\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono10-Italic;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(143,89,3)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMonoLt10-Bold;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-family:LMMono12-Regular;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(33,74,135)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(79,153,5)\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">The outcome graph supposed to be Figure 1, but I got Figure 2. Where is the lines of x-axis and y-axis? How can I fix it? Mybe I need the old version of ggplot2. I think it would be more easy for me to learn.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-mLmUfRNyLe8/V8QyVPcyOUI/AAAAAAAAAAY/aXHby7DujXsUFwzkfPyqGhcHZPbAP1zDQCLcB/s1600/%25